  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4642938bcfae179459fb2dc4c532ff29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialTextManager
  targetText: {fileID: 750601752}
  texts:
  - When a customer comes in, they will tell you their order.
  - Notice the timer at the top of your screen, that's how long you have to complete
    their order.
  - To make the customer's order, click the buttons that correspond to what they
    asked for.
  - For example, if they ordered a Big Fish with Lemon, you would click the Big Fish
    button and the Lemon button.
  - After you add all elements of the order, click Serve To Customer to give the
    customer their order.
  - The map can be accessed through the pause menu.
  - Press the X on this box when you are ready to begin.
